Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:03.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,What happens when AI blindly tunes an engine? It shatters the clutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:06.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Unless it has deterministic safety gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:09.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet MetaECU Copilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:13.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,We ingest the stock 2 MiB Bosch EDC16C39 flash,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:16.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,mapping all 774 calibration tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,The tuner asks for 450 Nm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:23.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meta Muse Spark plans the torque limiter curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,At 2200 RPM, the safety gate detects
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:29.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,clutch shear breakaway on the GM F40 gearbox —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:32.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,and halts execution instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:36.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Muse Spark clamps the plan to 376.5 Nm at the clutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:39.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Attempt two passes with zero slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:44.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Visual grounding inspects the effective clutch torque surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:50.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Replaying 33 real road logs: instant spool wins by 3.5 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:55.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,202.5 PS, zero slip — within the F40 limit.
